# DS-0002 (root user): .devcontainer/Dockerfile builds the dev and CI toolbox, never a deployed
# workload; Lambda runs on the AWS-managed runtime. The toolbox writes to the bind-mounted repo and
# reads the host's ~/.aws mounted at /root/.aws.
DS-0002

# AWS-0132 (S3 without a customer-managed KMS key): the state bucket uses SSE-S3. A CMK costs
# $1/month, and only idle-free resources persist between sessions.
AWS-0132
